      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID27",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "<b>Understanding Our Workforce</b><br>The number of immigrants in the workforce is a common worry among people in the country.<br><br>Most Americans, including Republicans and Democrats, believe that having correct and accurate information is important to making sound judgments and effective policy opinions. Knowing the facts helps us all, and we are committed to giving you the correct information.<br><br>To help you get an accurate picture, here is what official <b>2025</b> data from the nonpartisan U.S. Census Bureau indicates:<br>\u2022 Immigrants make up <i>X%</i> of all workers in the country.<br>\u2022 Immigrants make up <i>X%</i> of all workers in your state.",
